WEBVTT

00:26:28.036 --> 00:26:32.836
in other words, you know,
human rights atrocities,

00:26:32.876 --> 00:26:36.156
crimes against humanity,
genocide and the like,

00:26:36.196 --> 00:26:38.916
you absolutely have to know
where the truth is

00:26:38.956 --> 00:26:40.236
and what you're looking at

00:26:40.236 --> 00:26:43.316
so that you know that there are aggressors
and there are victims.

00:26:43.356 --> 00:26:44.876
There's no two ways about that.

00:26:44.916 --> 00:26:46.516
So my mantra is and has been,

00:26:46.556 --> 00:26:48.316
and I've developed that from Bosnia,

00:26:48.356 --> 00:26:51.756
which was one of my earliest
experiences in the field,

00:26:51.796 --> 00:26:54.556
my mantra is "truthful, not neutral,"

00:26:54.596 --> 00:26:57.276
which doesn't mean to say
I'm not being objective.

00:26:57.316 --> 00:27:00.356
I am being objective
because objective is our golden rule.